Package: melbheat
Title: Explore Hot Days and Hot Nights at Melbourne Airport
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tin", "Nguyen", email = "truongtin098@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides daily maximum and minimum temperature observations
    from the Melbourne Airport weather station (1970 to 2022), functions
    that count the days each year above a chosen temperature while
    accounting for missing observations, compare two periods, describe the
    result in plain language and test whether the conclusion depends on the
    definition of a hot day, ggplot2 charts for each result, and a Shiny app
    that lets a planner explore whether hot days and hot nights have become
    more frequent.
